{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36233","headline":"哭江西处士陈陶 · 方干","name":"哭江西处士陈陶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寿尽天年命不通，钓溪吟月便成翁。\n虽云挂剑来坟上，亦恐藏书在壁中。\n巢父精灵归大夜，客儿才调振遗风。\n南华至理须齐物，生死即应无异同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}